  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.07 “Competent evidence” means documents or testimony illustrating what a witness knew, heard, or saw.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
